id: ANS-019
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Raw module usage
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: raw
patterns:
  - regex: ^\s*-?\s*raw:
    message: "raw module bypasses Ansible module system — only use for bootstrapping Python"
fix: Replace raw with the appropriate Ansible module. raw is only needed when Python is not yet installed on the target. Use shell or command for other cases.
